  },
  "receipts": "endpoint-receipt-observations.json",
  "residual_risk": "An already authorized obligation outside the returned view could settle later, consume cash or shares and fees, or create/change a position. A new trade could then exceed the intended aggregate exposure/cash reservation or leave custody responsible for an incomplete inventory. Neither the amount of such residual obligations nor their last possible settlement time can be certified from these observations. This does not assert infinite loss or prove that a hidden obligation exists; token holdings, permissions and contract rules still constrain execution. The local first-live caps do not bound unknown pre-existing obligations.",
  "human_action": "Request from Polymarket a written scope contract or authoritative wallet-wide export covering every still-active owner obligation regardless of creating/revoked/deleted credentials, plus a cutoff tied to Polygon finality that covers pending cancellation, MATCHED, MINED, RETRYING, fees and settlement, with retention/indexing/retry timing and terminality rules. Existing exact read-only request: analysis/REMAINING_SETTLEMENT_DATA_REQUIREMENT.txt. No message sent.",
